01:15:32.416 --> 01:15:34.901
TA: We have programmer
and pro gamer.

01:15:34.901 --> 01:15:36.151
Two different things.

01:15:39.374 --> 01:15:41.859
AUDIENCE: Fishing.

01:15:41.859 --> 01:15:43.350
And losing weight.

01:15:52.830 --> 01:15:54.080
AUDIENCE: The historical
whaling industry.

01:15:56.800 --> 01:15:59.080
AUDIENCE: It's not a current
