AUDIENCE: Unions.

01:17:12.661 --> 01:17:14.649
TA: I'm starting to think
that [UNINTELLIGIBLE].

01:17:22.104 --> 01:17:23.595
AUDIENCE: Building a house.

01:17:29.062 --> 01:17:30.955
AUDIENCE: FedEx.

01:17:30.955 --> 01:17:32.205
TA: FedEx.

